'''Kano & Souma''' (セイバーオルタ) are a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that only appear in the [[Shoumetsu Toshi Collaboration Event]]. They were added in [[Version 8.6 Update|Version 8.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Kano & Souma
|image = E 461.png
|appearance = [[Shoumetsu Toshi Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 660¢ - 2,607¢
}}

==Enemy==
Kano & Souma are basically [[Takuya (Enemy)|Takuya]], but with lower stats and a 100% chance to produce a level 2 [[Wave Attack]]; essentially, just like a weaker [[Kory]].

==Strategy==
Any [[:Category:Cats with Wave Immunity|Wave Immune Units]] are ideal for this enemy. [[:Category:Wave Shield Cats|Wave Shields]] are even better. After that, use any other high DPS units to deal with them faster.

